.container
  h1 Import from SugarWOD
  p.text-muted
    | Upload the CSV export from your SugarWOD account. Workouts already in the catalog (benchmarks, hero WODs,
    | the Open) are matched by name; everything else is parsed automatically where possible, and anything that
    | can't be parsed is listed on the results page so you can review it.
  = form_with url: sugarwod_imports_path, method: :post, multipart: true do |f|
    .mb-3
      = f.label :file, 'SugarWOD CSV export', class: 'form-label'
      = f.file_field :file, class: 'form-control', required: true
    = f.submit 'Import', class: 'btn btn-outline-primary'
